      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li><b>New: Stick with the model that worked (on by default).</b> When your Gemini model is busy and Wisp finds another one that answers, it keeps using that one next time, so you don’t wait on the busy model again. You can turn it off or pick a model yourself in Settings.</li></ul>]]></description>
